sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Auditor (browser)
  participant API as Web + API service
  participant DB as Database

  U->>API: POST /issues (form) or POST /api/issues (JSON)<br/>session cookie + CSRF token
  API->>API: Session valid? else 302 /login or 401
  API->>API: CSRF token / JSON content-type check (403 / 415)
  API->>API: Validate title, page_url (http/https), WCAG, severity
  alt invalid input
    API-->>U: 400 { error: { code: validation_failed, fields } }<br/>HTML: form re-rendered, error summary focused,<br/>message next to each field, values kept
  else valid
    API->>DB: BEGIN
    API->>DB: INSERT issues (owner_id = session user, status = open)
    API->>DB: INSERT status_changes (NULL -> open)
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    alt database unavailable
      API-->>U: 503 "Nothing was saved, try again"<br/>(form values still in the browser)
    else committed
      API-->>U: 201 + Location (API) / 302 to /issues/:id (HTML)
      U->>API: GET /issues/:id
      API-->>U: Detail page + "Issue saved" in polite live region
    end
  end
